## One decision you should look at

The order's "post-start banner check (take the exact string from serve.py:465)" **cannot run where `stream_experts_missing` runs**: `serve.py:465` is printed by `_get_engine`, called only from the patched `stream_generate` (`serve.py:443-471`), i.e. on the first request — a check before the first request would FAIL every OptiQ depth cell forever. I read "post-start" as the order's own premise requires (the line must be able to appear) and asked it one workload in; the site, the reason and the caveat are documented at `Optiq.mtp_depth_missing` and in `measure._visit`. If you want it literally at the streaming check's site instead, say so — but the pin becomes unmeasurable.

